  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧電網",
    "sub_ename": "SMART GRID",
    "describe_ch": "為使學生了解再生能源發電系統對電網之貢獻，傳統發電系統、再生能源發電系統、系統衝擊等電網併聯技術以及先進電錶和智慧型電網等技術將在本課程中導入，以增進電網管理，此外智慧電網基礎設計、建築與都市設計也將導入課程中作為實務性的探討。智慧型電網技術將可增進傳統發電系統與再生能源發電系統協調與合作。",
    "describe_eh": "For the purpose to comprehend the contribution of renewable power facilities to the power system, traditional power system, renewable power system, system impact, and smart grid technologies will be introduced in this course to analyze power grid system management. The understanding of smart grid technology can be use to increase the interoperable of renewable power system and traditional power system.",
